---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Knife and Axe Thrower"
  description="An app for iPhone and Android that scores knife and axe throws with your phone's camera."
>
  <h1>Score every throw</h1>
  <p>
    Knife and Axe Thrower is an app for iPhone and Android. Set your phone on a mount to the
    side of the lane, point it at your board, and it scores each knife or axe throw for you.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Play on your own or with a friend, on one board or two.</li>
    <li>Quick draw: two throwers on a countdown; the first knife to stick wins.</li>
    <li>Your games are kept on your phone, with an optional account to back them up.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Coming soon</strong> to the App Store and Google Play.</p>
  <p class="safety">
    Keep your phone, and yourself, out of the line of throw. The app can't tell whether the
    lane is clear.
  </p>
</Base>

<style>
  .safety {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
